---
description: API and WebSocket contract rules
globs:
  - "backend/api/**/*.py"
  - "frontend/hooks/**/*.ts"
  - "frontend/lib/**/*.ts"
  - "schemas/**/*.ts"
---

# API rules
- Keep REST routes thin and schema-driven.
- WebSocket messages must be versioned.
- Every server event must have a client-side type.
- Prefer additive changes over breaking changes.
- Preserve existing event names unless absolutely necessary.

# Contract workflow
- Define schema first.
- Implement backend emitter.
- Update frontend parser.
- Add sample payloads.
- Test reconnect and partial streaming.
